        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: हेवा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हेवा — hevā — \"envy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मित्राच्या नव्या सायकलचा त्याला हेवा वाटला. mitrācyā navyā sāykalcā tyālā hevā vāṭlā. He envied his friend's new bicycle."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हेवा (hevā) वाटणे, to envy: the dative for the one who envies, the genitive for the thing. Milder than मत्सर."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हेवा (hevā) is a Marathi noun whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
